{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hunted Within: The Walls&quot; is a gripping first-person horror  survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.poster.avif?t=1772722548\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.webm?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/e2660b21f6ca1bff4af637dc891288bf.mp4?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost with no memory, trapped behind massive walls, and must venture through eerie areas Each delivers a unique horror experience, pushing your courage and curiosity to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.poster.avif?t=1772722548\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.webm?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/d829e2201b49826385089d98e1a4c6ce.mp4?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly dangerous enemies, from silent stalkers in the forest to horrors lurking in the caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.poster.avif?t=1772722548\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.webm?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/extras/68e57a3ff693aecfa20c3fdf7bd7df82.mp4?t=1772722548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and\u00a0blueprints  to craft deadly weapons, Items and survival gear that will help you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth hidden within the maze by hunting down rare Artifact Stones\u2014essential keys throughout the story, and Find out who's Behind all of this!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prologue Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3439440/e14dad35d969be603ca8bb737b04863420039737.jpg"},{"name":"New Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3439440/a9440861b3d6736444482aa3f87a5a006d0ee8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Marked by the Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3439440/242d1dcab27766ee7bedcd0588e7aa23661cc287.jpg"},{"name":"Artifacts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3439440/a1c4468d9374d303c1926738359a9e3a0c239b1d.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3439440/4c4e97bfeb4c314a593be2466e69b5166eb5add6.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439440?t=1772722548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439440/df1ed76ef27421c95db815c6a685